#: ../../library/operator.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!operator` --- Standard operators as functions"
msgstr ":mod:`!operator` --- Standardoperatorer som funktioner"

#: ../../library/operator.rst:9
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/operator.py`"
